ht/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow Fox News on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/FoxNews/&amp;#10;Follow Fox News on Twitter: https://twitter.com/FoxNews/&amp;#10;Follow Fox News on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/foxnews/"
