    date "2020-06-01T11:03:32Z"
    title "Trump is to right "
    description "Anarchist group Antifa is engaging in &amp;#34;text book terrorism&amp;#34; and deserve to be labelled as such, according to Sky News contributor Daisy Cousens.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In the wake of a spate of violent riots across the US, President Donald Trump on Sunday said he will designate Antifa as a &amp;#34;terrorist organisation&amp;#34;.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Antifa are a loose collection of groups, who believe in aggressively combating right-wing movements, while claiming to be anti-fascist.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Ms Cousens told Sky News Trump should &amp;#34;absolutely&amp;#34; make good on his promise to label Antifa a domestic terrorist organisation.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#34;What they do is engaging in violence in the purpose of politics of politics and ideology,&amp;#34; she said.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#34;That right there is terrorism.&amp;#34;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#34;Antifa is not a wholly domestic group.... if he manages to do that, it will open up a whole lot of legal avenues to deal with them.&amp;#34;"
