  [
    id 92
    label "X8SIVkfEO0g"
    step 0
    date "2020-11-15T19:33:18Z"
    title "Trump supporters clash with Antifa protesters during  in DC"
    description "Anti-fascism protesters have burnt Trump flags and pro-police gear while shouting &amp;#8220;f**k Trump&amp;#8221; during the MAGA march in Washington.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Violence erupted on the streets of the capital after the &amp;#34;Million MAGA March&amp;#8221; as Antifa and Proud Boys clashed.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thousands of Trump supporters had participated in a &amp;#34;Million Maga March&amp;#34; as they filled the streets of DC, heading to the Supreme Court.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Demonstrators echoed baseless claims from Donald Trump, who has claimed he won the election and there was voter fraud.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Amid the Saturday march, counter-protesters &amp;#8211; including Antifa demonstrators &amp;#8211; showed up.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;READ MORE:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Anti-fascism protesters &amp;#8216;burn Trump flags and pro-police gear while shouting &amp;#8220;f**k Trump&amp;#8221;&amp;#8216; during MAGA March&amp;#10;https://www.the-sun.com/news/1803445/anti-fascism-protesters-burn-trump-flags-maga/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Fox News host Jeanine Pirro slams people telling Trump to &amp;#8216;accept he lost and move on&amp;#8217; in wild rant&amp;#10;https://www.the-sun.com/news/1803252/fox-news-jeanine-pirro-slams-people-trump-lost/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Donald Trump hits the golf course for second day in a row after AGAIN refusing to concede to Joe Biden&amp;#10;https://www.the-sun.com/news/1804230/donald-trump-golf-course-virginia-president-election/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Scary vid shows bloodied Trump fan at &amp;#8216;Million MAGA March&amp;#8217; fall after &amp;#8216;being assaulted by anti-fascism protester&amp;#8217;&amp;#10;https://www.the-sun.com/news/1801402/vid-bloodied-trump-fan-maga-march-fall-assaulted/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;From Brexit breaking news to HD movie trailers, The Sun newspaper brings you the latest news videos and explainers from the UK and around the world.&amp;#13;&amp;#10;&amp;#13;&amp;#10;Become a Sun Subscriber and hit the bell to be the first to know&amp;#13;&amp;#10;&amp;#13;&amp;#10;Read The Sun: http://www.thesun.co.uk&amp;#13;&amp;#10;Like The Sun on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/thesun/&amp;#13;&amp;#10;Follow The Sun on Twitter: https://twitter.com/TheSun&amp;#13;&amp;#10;Subscribe to The Sun on Snapchat: https://www.snapchat.com/discover/The_Sun/1633225139"
