    title "Those in Antifa are : Bernardi"
    description "Sky News host Cory Bernardi says the people in Antifa are &amp;#34;everything that they claim not to be&amp;#34;.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#34;Fascists who masquerade as anti-fascists,&amp;#34; Mr Bernardi said.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#34;They are violent, they are racist, and they're oppressors of anyone or anything that they don't like.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#34;They loathe democracy and freedom and they actually trace their roots back to the Communist movement.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#34;That was in 1932 in Germany, the Antifaschistische Aktion as they were known, was founded by the Stalinist Communist Party.&amp;#34;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Mr Bernardi spoke to The Post Millennial's Editor-at-Large Andy Ngo, who has experienced the violence of Antifa first-hand. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#34;When you dive into the actual history of the what the original Antifa did ... they were involved in really brutal street violence,&amp;#34; Mr Ngo said."
