ome and help you they&amp;#8217;ll come and help you&amp;#10;Little kid, you need to fight, &amp;#10;To survive you need to shoot, you need to shoot&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Angry faces lining up, before the storm&amp;#10;Never really wanted that, I prefer love&amp;#10;But sometimes I just can&amp;#8217;t help me&amp;#10;Then I want to kill authority&amp;#10;&amp;#10;And the Antifa Kids run down the street&amp;#10;And they run until they die&amp;#10;And the Antifa Kids run down the street&amp;#10;And they run until they die&amp;#10;And the Antifa Kids run down the street&amp;#10;And they run until they die&amp;#10;And the Antifa Kids run down the street&amp;#10;And they run until they die&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Oh little kid, no need to cry, &amp;#10;One day they will come and help you they&amp;#8217;ll come and help you&amp;#10;Little kid, you need to fight, &amp;#10;To survive you need to shoot, you need to shoot&amp;#10;&amp;#10;So come on all you outlaws, rebells and punks&amp;#10;You need to stand as one&amp;#10;&amp;#8216;Cause every single one of you can help&amp;#10;Only together we are strong&amp;#10;Social bastards without any rights and any hope don&amp;#8217;t care about death&amp;#10;Fuck sexism, homophobia and racism &amp;#8217;till our last breath&amp;#10;&amp;#10;And the Antifa Kids run down the street&amp;#10;And the Antifa Kids run down the street&amp;#10;And the Antifa Kids run down the street&amp;#10;And they run until they die&amp;#10;And the Antifa Kids run down the street&amp;#10;And they run until they die&amp;#10;&amp;#10;And the Antifa Kids run down the street&amp;#10;And they run until they die&amp;#10;And the Antifa kids run down the street&amp;#10;And they run until they die&amp;#10;And the Antifa kids run down the street&amp;#10;And they run until they die&amp;#10;And the Antifa kids run down the street&amp;#10;Until they die"
