    date "2020-06-05T00:30:02Z"
    title "WHAT IS ANTIFA?"
    description "What is Antifa is what I asked myself a few weeks ago when watching the news? I did some research and what I found was shocking. The Antifa movement has been around for decades but only gaining attention in the last few years. Recently their name has been in the news because they have been blamed for a lot of the provoking and inciting of the BLM protests. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;I decided to make this video because a lot of business owners have been completely devastated by the recent events that many are blaming on the Antifa group. So if you're asking yourself what is Antifa and are they responsible for the protest shinanigans? You're going to want to watch this video.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128071;&amp;#128071;&amp;#128071;&amp;#128071;Feed Needy Families Here in the US &amp;#128071;&amp;#128071;&amp;#128071;&amp;#128071;&amp;#10;         &amp;#127823;&amp;#127831;&amp;#127838;&amp;#129472; https://bit.ly/2LRTFFk &amp;#127823;&amp;#127831;&amp;#127838;&amp;#129472;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128071;&amp;#128071;&amp;#128071;&amp;#128071;Learn About Culture Estate&amp;#128071;&amp;#128071;&amp;#128071;&amp;#128071;&amp;#10;            &amp;#128222;&amp;#9742;&amp;#128248;&amp;#128218;www.Culture.Estate&amp;#128222;&amp;#9742;&amp;#128248;&amp;#128218;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Sources:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://abcnews.go.com/Politics/antifa-group-trump-designate-terrorist-organization/story?id=71045287&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://www.foxbusiness.com/lifestyle/what-is-antifa-and-who-funds-it&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2020/06/antifa-200601170721571.html&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#whatisantifa #antifa #whoisantifa"
