    date "2020-08-28T23:36:25Z"
    title "The Lost History of Antifa"
    description "Tonight we're joined by Jacobin contributing editor Loren Balhorn, to uncover the lost history of Antifa&amp;#8212; shorthand for decentralized, militant street activism associated with its own aesthetic and subculture. The movement&amp;#8217;s short but inspiring political legacy proved too uncomfortable for both Cold War-era German states, and was ignored in schools and mainstream history.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press like and subscribe!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Subscribe to Jacobin: https://jacobinmag.com/subscribe/?code=AFTERBERNIE"
