ep the system in check&amp;#8217;&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=deWfBj2MZJY&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9632;What is Antifa and are they 'domestic terrorists'? | ABC News&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bmMf6OdgUwY&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9632;Antifa Members Talk Protest Tactics: &amp;#8216;We Don&amp;#8217;t Depend On Cops&amp;#8217; | NBC News&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=af5o-4eI9PA&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9632;Trump to designate &amp;#8216;antifa&amp;#8217; as terrorist organization after unrest over George Floyd's death&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vrGWjMnHBp8&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9632;Antifa: The Anti-Fascist Antagonists of the Alt-Right: The Daily Show&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kmpqnxpYUqA&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9632;What is Antifa?&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Idjx_eUjTgo&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9632;Antifa's Violent History Explained | NowThis World&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kRXlAu1Pjsg"
