    description "Dozens brawled in Los Angeles Saturday afternoon on the outskirts of a &amp;#34;Choose Freedom&amp;#34; rally, leaving one person confirmed stabbed and none arrested.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Video shot by Andrew Kimmel of the fight at another angle shows an apparent right-winger smash an apparent counter-protester in the back of the neck with a weapon. The victim has not come forward, and the type of weapon is currently unclear. Some are saying the incident is a second stabbing.&amp;#10;https://twitter.com/andrewkimmel/status/1427763249185886209&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The protesters said their event was to oppose what they call &amp;#8220;medical tyranny, mandatory vaccinations and vaccine passports.&amp;#34; Antifa counter-demonstrated, and one person in black-bloc stabbed an apparent rally participant with a knife during the ensuing fight.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;One right-wing activist attacked News2Share's own cameraman twice but was later forced out of the event by his own side for instigating violence.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Filmed by N2S Contributor Jake Lee Green&amp;#10;&amp;#10;NO REUSE WITHOUT PERMISSION Please contact Ford Fischer at fordfischer@news2share.com or call (573) 575-NEWS to license video. Photos and additional footage may be available upon request.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Support News2Share on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/FordFischer&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Special Thanks to Patreon Contributors Ardel David, Dustin Gagne, and Emily Molli&amp;#10;&amp;#10;See more at http://News2share.com"
