    description "SACRAMENTO, CALIFORNIA - On Wednesday afternoon, January 20, 2021, a few hundred Antifa members protested throughout the downtown Sacramento area, near the State Capitol Building. Most armed with makeshift shields and sticks and they chanted &amp;#34;Whose Streets? Our Streets&amp;#34;; &amp;#34;Black Lives Matter&amp;#34; and &amp;#34;F Trump and Biden.&amp;#34; At one point while at the State Capitol Building Antifa members set off a canister of pink smoke. Two Trump supporters were also chased out of Fremont Park by Antifa members with what appeared to be bats. No injuries were reported. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;LLN IG - https://www.instagram.com/loudlabs_news/?hl=en&amp;#10;LLN FB - https://www.facebook.com/LoudLabsNews/"
