    title "Chaos after Antifa shows up to GOP rally"
    description "Chaos after Antifa shows up to GOP rally&amp;#10;Due to a lack of resources, the resource-strapped When claimed Antifa activists stormed a Saturday campaign event near police headquarters in downtown Portland, it took more than 20 minutes for the Portland Police Bureau (PPB) to respond.&amp;#10;According to police, the black-clad demonstrators had already dispersed after launching smoke grenades, paint-filled balloons, and fireworks by the time cops arrived with &amp;#34;sufficient resources&amp;#34; to set up a crime scene near Southwest 3rd and Main Street. According to authorities, two people were injured by &amp;#34;mortars.&amp;#34;&amp;#10;The event in support of Republican gubernatorial candidate Stan Pulliam, whose platform includes reimbursing the police, was curtailed short due to the demonstrators' violence.&amp;#10;&amp;#34;This is what happens when a Republican dares to hold a town hall meeting in Portland to discuss police budget. &amp;#34;Antifa arrives,&amp;#34; Pulliam tweeted, accompanied by video of the incident.&amp;#10;donald trump,trump,black lives matter,president donald trump,donald trump interview,antifa,portland protest,portland,proud boys in portland,what is antifa,portland news,portland protests,portland protests this weekend,portland rally,protest portland,portland oregon protests,antifada,portland antifa,united states,Chaos after Antifa shows up to GOP rally,GOP rally,Portland Police Bureau,black-clad demonstrators,Black clad,Stan Pulliam"
