  [
    id 389
    label "5jo2SGgwavw"
    step 0
    date "2020-10-01T00:40:50Z"
    title "Joe Biden"
    description "When Joe Biden lied to America and said &amp;#34;Antifa's an idea, not an organization&amp;#34; I knew we had to expose how ridiculous it was. Share this far and wide! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;The GrowUp Show + Podcast hosted by husband &amp;#38; wife team Landon &amp;#38; Robby Starbuck is centered on discussion, interviews, examination and debate around hot button issues of our time. We aren't afraid to talk about or debate the hard topics that the left so often seeks to silence. We are the new generation of of pragmatic Republicans who put America First.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;To Support the show, you can contribute here: https://www.patreon.com/GrowUpLive&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For More visit: https://GrowUpLive.com&amp;#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/growuplive&amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/growupliveshow/&amp;#10;Support our show and our creation of documentaries: Paypal robbystarbuck@gmail.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Robby Starbuck is married to singer/songwriter @imatriarch. They live in Tennessee with their 3 children. Robby is a Cuban-American producer &amp;#38; director. He&amp;#8217;s the founder and director of his production company RSMCreative which has a long history of world class directors for their projects in Music, Film, Television, Documentaries and Commercials. RSMCreative projects have received awards from YouTube, MTV, Much Music Video Awards, Kerrang! , AP and more! Collectively RSMCreative&amp;#8217;s work has been viewed more than 10 billion times between internet &amp;#38; television.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Robby has worked with a diverse range of clients &amp;#38; artists. He has directed or produced big names like Natalie Portman, Jamie Foxx, Gina Rodriguez, Megan Fox, Snoop Dogg,  Akon, Brad Pitt, Big Sean, Megadeth, The Gaslight Anthem, Gucci Mane, Ty Dolla $ign,  Black Veil Brides, All Time Low, Five Finger Death Punch, Asking Alexandria, Escape The Fate, Krewella, Shiny Toy Guns, Metric, Sarah Bareilles, Smashing Pumpkins, Machine Gun Kelly, Big Sean, Matisyahu, Dirty Heads, Skillet, Paramount Pictures, Sony Pictures, Warner Brothers, Universal Music Group, Atlantic Records, Republic Records, Aspiration, Sherlock Gnomes, Transformers, Terminator, Spongebob Movie, Annihilation, Action Point, Pet Cemetary, Ben-Hur, Allied and many more!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Robby made the decision to boldly come out as a Republican in 2015 &amp;#38; his involvement being an outspoken political influencer grew quickly. He decided he would rather risk his future in Hollywood than risk remaining silent. Robby has been on Fox Business, Varney, Fox, Newsmakers, OANN,  Breitbart Radio, Hugh Hewitt, Varney, Bill O&amp;#8217;Reilly,  870 AM, Red-Pilled America, &amp;#38; more. He also has op-eds in LA Times &amp;#38; OC Register. Now Robby speaks to audiences and uses his platform to inspire change, bring new voters to the Republican party, inspire truth seeking and to inspire others to be culture warriors who challenge the far left culture infecting all forms of entertainment &amp;#38; education.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Landon (also known as &amp;#8220;Matriarch&amp;#8221;) is Robby&amp;#8217;s wife &amp;#38; mother of 3. She&amp;#8217;s an alternative singer/songwriter and multi instrumentalist who has charted on billboard, toured the U.S. with radio hits on KROQ, KISS FM, etc. She started her own record label, publishing company and has composed for TV shows like Real World, 90210, The Real L World, films &amp;#38; more. She moved to L.A. from Texas at age 18 with no industry connections and paved her own way. She learned the insides of the music industry not just on a business level but on a cultural level.  Through those experiences she discovered a dark underbelly of the industry which inspired her passion to be protect children. She decided to leave the industry to make music on her own terms; writing, playing, producing herself, donating all proceeds to anti-trafficking rescue and restoration initiatives.  Landon is a fearless, outspoken conservative artist, woman and mother. She uses her platform to inform, educate and empower others. She&amp;#8217;s a fierce advocate for children, trafficking victims and family values."
    channeltitle "RobbyStarbuck"
