    id 394
    label "gz4ICJ3_9YY"
    step 0
    date "2020-02-11T18:47:11Z"
    title "Antifa in Budapest, Hungary and abroad"
    description "When hearing &amp;#34;Antifa&amp;#34; most people associate the name with its implied meaning and recent headlines - a group of people dedicated to fighting fascism and racism by confronting radical far-right groups at protests.&amp;#10;I have watched a good amount of videos online about Antifa from a distance, with some popcorn next to me, being somewhat relieved that we in Hungary don't have to put up with the activities they do in the United States.&amp;#10;The other week, domestic and foreign Antifa groups have held a rally in Budapest, attacking people in the streets. Their performance wasn't as radical as in the US, but regardless it appeared to be testing the limits of what they could get away with.&amp;#10;This video compilation is for educational purposes: its aim is to provide insight into the group's real intentions and methodologies, relying mostly on raw footage and some sarcastic captions. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Closed Captions included to translate Hungarian parts of the video to English and vice versa. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;All video clips belong to their respective owners. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;[ Video clips ] &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://444.hu/&amp;#10;https://merce.hu/&amp;#10;https://blikk.hu/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://www.projectveritasaction.com/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/bX3EZCVj2XA&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/ImH8AjZrEcY&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/P3PWDNkLliE&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/4zpCVM0delQ&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/BsUAvh_PCWA&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/avbIhMi9OWg&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/digrtFDLdzo&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/S33HVduI474&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/R_8Wpv8eFA4&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/NXSM9MIQMWc&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/IXBT5PHwitM&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/W1ZNprqBgnE&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/eWxBxrlgwCs&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/ZGaIFfH7bT0&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/ivgwTZDEQho&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/Yz1X4PwWy2g&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/KKyVe-bgdK8&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/Q-xTzd23h2Q&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/cGUCq5fpMGo&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/DZ02eeYPKEU&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/VNNHFpg3lZw&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/bwE620VkaD0&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/qCsKiQ4TRs0&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/1qoo5-HIHAI&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/TDxxeH1za98&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/dO2H_yT9A0U&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/6-49pkRiID0&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/jcHBUQjCivQ&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/X1GcsZ2SFFw&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/896IEK9B-ls&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/HtlCo80DQ64&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/paBh7P47SL8&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/6IQSmqOaZoA&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/-pvf8ftpRWg&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/w2ubU6lN_iI&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/ehT8YoxUb30&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/kzO-AGWmTUc&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/yDKtmC7OROM&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/swuXd5-2IpA&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/qE4DMJiPKF4&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/10j_D6_SvI4&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/tbuqpc9t0HU&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/9KTGrqEfTHU&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/NsT1Qrhi2gU&amp;#10;&amp;#10;[ Soundtrack ]&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Noisia - Believe&amp;#10;Noisia - Into Dust"
