    description "It was really scary. Really chaotic. My children were screaming. This was one of the most horrifying things my children had to see. A mob of grown adults wearing BLM t-shirts and masks over their faces, screaming racial obscenity while charging at a mixed racial family coming from a peaceful rally. - recalls Rayla Campbell Republican candidate for Congress MA-7, in an interview with Eunika Chojecka for Against the Tide TV.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://againstthetide.tv/2020/11/20/blm-antifa-attack-children-black-republican-congress-candidate&amp;#10;http://www.raylaforcongress.com/&amp;#10;https://twitter.com/Rayla4Congress&amp;#10;--&amp;#10;#ChristianNotPacifist&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Watch Pastor Pawe&amp;#322; Chojecki's (the most known Pastor in Poland) preaching about how to drive communists out of Christian Churches:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Intro: https://youtu.be/-FrNkqTzXXU&amp;#10;::Full episodes::&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to drive communists out of our Churches: &amp;#10;https://youtu.be/DWLETgS4wK8 [ENG subs]&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/S5lEjesQBE8 [ENG dubbed]&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The Communists Want to Subvert You!: &amp;#10;https://youtu.be/d9fccewM548 [ENG subs]&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/3hR2FvcaAXo [ENG dubbed]&amp;#10;&amp;#10;State Idolatry: &amp;#10;https://youtu.be/Ei8pdB5eVOY [ENG subs]&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/Gug2HHEmh9U [END dubbed]&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Globalism, how does GOD see it: https://youtu.be/1d1-yqaNoOY&amp;#10;&amp;#10;All of Pastor Pawe&amp;#322;'s teachings and interviews in English&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tx9JIYpnl0k&amp;#38;list=PLTVU7uXBYEWT_bLIZwGAsNMdJz37p5Nc7&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please Share and Like.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;http://megachurch.pl/&amp;#10;https://againstthetide.tv/&amp;#10;https://www.facebook.com/againstthetidetv&amp;#10;https://twitter.com/AgainstTideTV&amp;#10;https://parler.com/profile/againstthetidetv&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/againstthetidetv/"
